  "kind": "statement",
  "title": "Global generation descends along a closed immersion",
  "statement": "Let i : X \\to Y be a closed immersion of schemes and let M be an O_X-module ([def-pc-morphism-conventions]). If the pushforward i_* M is generated by global sections, then M is generated by global sections.",
